WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
[Draft struck]
"Our team launched..."

00:02.300 --> 00:05.500
"Our church gathered neighboring
households to read Mark

00:05.500 --> 00:07.600
in our own language."
Elders edit.

00:07.600 --> 00:10.500
"Not this spring. Our congregation
is grieving."

00:10.500 --> 00:13.600
Visit postponed; prayer continues
until elders invite.

00:13.600 --> 00:16.000
"It is our vision to plant
a Gospel witness

00:16.000 --> 00:17.900
within 30 minutes
of everyone."

00:17.900 --> 00:20.800
Church Planting · Local Leadership
Unreached People

00:20.800 --> 00:22.600
Request a Bridge Project match.

00:22.600 --> 00:25.000
info@globalfellowship.org
No gift expected.
